## Description

Your perfect companion for a walk in the city where you need only a few items with you. This small card holder is also ideal if you want a discrete wallet to put in a smoking. 🤵

This minimalist wallet is made to hold 2 cards on the 2 side pockets and around 4 cards or any bills and tickets in the middle pocket.

The leather is wonderful and changes color with the light and friction or physical constraints (when you fold it for instance)

[🎨 Play with the colours](https://lord.crofte.fr/leather-color-picker/?c2=brown&c1=blue&p=2)

Its middle thumb hole is made to easily push the cards from the pocket, if pulling is not your thing 😁👍

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

